Merlin's python/merlin/ssd_parallax_reference.py implements the published
single-query, single-head attention algebra with a new bounded file-backed
FP64 storage/accumulation path and a resident covariance comparison. It does
not bundle the upstream PyTorch/Triton implementations or trained weights.
